            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aya makani akaba kuti kuciindi ecino kujanza lyambungano beendelezi abasibwami bamumasena aakujulu bazibisigwe busongo bwamisyobo misyobo bwa-Leza, ",
          "type": "text",
